\" aria-controls=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ada-neascope\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ada-neascope-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >\u0154ada neaSCOPE<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p>Vysok\u00e9 prostorov\u00e9 rozli\u0161en\u00ed infra\u010derven\u00e9 mikroskopie v bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli umo\u017e\u0148uje se syst\u00e9my <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/products\/neaspec-microscopes\/\"><strong>\u0159ady neaSCOPE<\/strong><\/a> podrobn\u00e9 studium f\u00e1zov\u00fdch p\u0159echod\u016f v materi\u00e1lech, jako je nap\u0159\u00edklad p\u0159echod izol\u00e1toru na kov v tenk\u00fdch vrst\u00e1ch oxidu vanadi\u010dit\u00e9ho (VO<sub>2<\/sub>).<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9927\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9927\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9927 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/df641878-1024x546.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/df641878-1024x546.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/df641878-300x160.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/df641878-768x410.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/df641878.jpg 1160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9927\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Anal\u00fdza teplotn\u011b indukovan\u00e9ho f\u00e1zov\u00e9ho p\u0159echodu oxidu vanadi\u010dit\u00e9ho<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Infra\u010derven\u00e1 mikroskopie v bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli poskytuje nov\u00fd pohled na teplotn\u011b indukovan\u00fd f\u00e1zov\u00fd p\u0159echod VO<sub>2<\/sub>. Nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 data p\u0159\u00edmo potvrzuj\u00ed perkolativn\u00ed povahu f\u00e1zov\u00e9ho p\u0159echodu tenk\u00e9ho filmu VO<sub>2<\/sub>, kde izola\u010dn\u00ed a kovov\u00e1 f\u00e1ze koexistuj\u00ed v teplotn\u00edm rozsahu, ve kter\u00e9m k p\u0159echodu doch\u00e1z\u00ed. Data nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 pro vlnovou d\u00e9lku 10,75 \u00b5m p\u0159i \u0159\u00edzen\u00e9 zm\u011bn\u011b teploty mezi 340 K a 343 K odhaluj\u00ed, jak se tvo\u0159\u00ed kovov\u00e9 \u201enano-lou\u017ee\u201c, kter\u00e9 vykazuj\u00ed vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed amplitudu sign\u00e1lu pro oblasti kovov\u00fdch vzork\u016f ve srovn\u00e1n\u00ed s izolantem.<\/p><p>Mapy zm\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 pro f\u00e1zov\u00e9 p\u0159echody tenk\u00e9ho filmu VO<sub>2<\/sub> ukazuj\u00ed, \u017ee IR mikroskopie v bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli umo\u017e\u0148uje podrobn\u00e9 studie f\u00e1zov\u00fdch p\u0159echod\u016f v nanomateri\u00e1lech. Techniku \u200b\u200blze aplikovat nejen na f\u00e1zov\u00e9 p\u0159echody souvisej\u00edc\u00ed s VO<sub>2<\/sub>, ale i na <strong>v\u0161echny ostatn\u00ed f\u00e1zov\u00e9 zm\u011bny<\/strong>, p\u0159i kter\u00fdch doch\u00e1z\u00ed k\u00a0dielektrick\u00e9mu\/kovov\u00e9mu nebo amorfn\u00edmu\/krystalick\u00e9mu p\u0159echodu (jako u slitin GeSbTe).<\/p><p>O dal\u0161\u00edch aplikac\u00edch se m\u016f\u017eete <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/application\/e-book-nanoscale-analysis-of-inorganic-materials\/\">dozv\u011bd\u011bt zde<\/a>.<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ada-neascope-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ada-neascope-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5032\" class=\"elementor elementor-5032\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-66c51c3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"66c51c3\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-34ebf637\" data-id=\"34ebf637\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dce-fix-background-loop elementor-element elementor-element-43f4b2a9 templatemode-yes elementor-widget elementor-widget-dyncontel-acfposts\" data-id=\"43f4b2a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"dyncontel-acfposts.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"acfposts-grid dce-posts-wrap simple-style\" data-style=\"simple\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div data-dce-post-id=\"9778\" class=\"dce-post-item dce-post-item-9778 dce-elementor-9778 column-  \">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dce-w